    {"answer": "A", "reason_rejected": "Incorrect because the image size increases (gets taller) as the object approaches the focal point, not shorter."},
    {"answer": "C", "reason_rejected": "Incorrect because the image distance increases (moves away from the mirror), not decreases (toward the mirror)."},
    {"answer": "D", "reason_rejected": "Incorrect because the image moves away from the mirror, not toward it."}
